# Timeline, Audio & Animation Reference

## Overview

The timeline system handles audio playback and beat/measure visualization. The `TimelineContainer` at the bottom of the workspace shows pages, audio waveforms, and timing markers. During playback, the field samples the timeline resolver at the audio clock's beat each frame.

